(ROOMRENT PROJECT ARCHITECTURE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(RoomRent is a Flask web app for browsing rental listings behind login-protected pages. It) Tj
T*
(combines server-rendered Jinja templates with client-side JavaScript that fetches JSON APIs) Tj
T*
(and fills listing/property views.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(TOP-LEVEL STRUCTURE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(app.py: Flask application, routes, authentication flow, API endpoints, inquiry form, and app) Tj
T*
(startup.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(auth_store.py: local JSON-backed user storage for phone OTP users and Google OAuth profiles.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(db.py: data access layer for MySQL with a demo-data fallback.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(templates/: Jinja HTML templates for shared layout, home, auth pages, property detail, and) Tj
T*
(404.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(static/css/styles.css: all styling and responsive layout rules.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(static/js/app.js: browser-side API loading, rendering, and small UI behaviors.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(.env: local runtime configuration and secrets, ignored by Git.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(instance/users.json: runtime user data created by auth_store.py, ignored by Git.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(RUNTIME DIAGRAM) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Browser -> Flask routes in app.py -> Jinja templates in templates/ -> CSS/JS from static/.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Browser JavaScript -> /api/storage, /api/listings, /api/listings/<id> -> app.py -> db.py ->) Tj
T*
(MySQL or SAMPLE_LISTINGS.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Auth routes in app.py -> auth_store.py -> instance/users.json.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Inquiry form -> /inquiry -> db.py -> MySQL inquiries table or DEMO_INQUIRIES memory list.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(AUTHENTICATION ARCHITECTURE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Phone login/signup starts in /login or /signup and calls _start_phone_otp.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The OTP is generated in app.py, hashed with Werkzeug, and stored in the Flask session with) Tj
T*
(an expiry timestamp.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(In local demo mode, the OTP is also flashed/shown to the user instead of being sent by SMS.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(/verify-otp checks expiry and hash, then creates or updates the user through auth_store.py.) Tj
T*
